  "description": "Stable generic execution envelope. Owns framing, identity, the eight generic event kinds, typed values (TAGGED_ITEM | INTEGER | EMPTY), locations (ARRAY_CELL | SCALAR), storage declarations (ARRAY | SCALAR), and operands (VALUE | PARAMETER | INTEGER | ARGUMENT). Problem, precondition and result are opaque objects here and are validated by the content-addressed profile the run binds (profile_id + profile_schema_digest). CORE_SCHEMA_VALID and PROFILE_SCHEMA_VALID are both required. No presentation fields.",
